v></div></h1><p><span>Only a few days into January 2024, the Mistral AI tea=
m shared the </span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.04088">Mixtral of=
 Experts</a><span> paper (8 Jan 2024), which described Mixtral 8x7B, a Spar=
se Mixture of Experts (SMoE) model.</span></p><p>The paper and model were b=
oth very influential at the time, as Mixtral 8x7B was (one of) the first op=
en-weight MoE LLMs with an impressive performance: it outperformed Llama 2 =
70B and GPT-3.5 across various benchmarks.</p><h2 class=3D"header-anchor-po=
st"><strong>1.1 Understanding MoE models</strong><div class=3D"pencraft pc-=
