href=3D"https://amzn.to/4fqvn0D">Build A Large Language Model (From Scratch=
)</a><span> book.</span></p><p><span>Since LoRA is such a popular and widel=
y used method, and since I had so much fun implementing and playing with a =
newer variant, my pick for February is </span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/=
