sed part of Dolma 1.6 (3T tokens) and 1.7 (1.2T tokens), The Pile (340B tok=
ens), SlimPajama (627B tokens), the deduplicated variant of RedPajama (20T =
tokens), English CommonCrawl section of Matrix (1.3T tokens), English CC-10=
0 (70B tokens), Colossal-OSCAR (850B tokens).</p><p><span>For example, ~360=
 billion tokens are only suited for small LLMs (for instance, 1.7 B, accord=
